<title>GERMANY: Buba's Kuehbacher opposes relaxing EMU criteria.</title>
<headline>Buba's Kuehbacher opposes relaxing EMU criteria.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Klaus-Dieter Kuehbacher on Monday said he opposed any relaxation of the criteria nations need to meet to join Europe's planned currency union.</p>
<p>&quot;I oppose any relaxation of the entry criteria for EMU,&quot; Kuehbacher said.</p>
</text>
